Subject: Cantor Provider-Free Portable Release Bundle P0 Solution

@ [solution_uuid] 8ac5be3e-7a39-4052-8b24-f2d680dcadba

& [Implementation]
  + strict generator binds published source Cargo.lock windows-x86_64 and four exact bounded release binaries
  + generated README and manifest bytes join the binaries into an exact six-entry ordinal ZIP with store compression zero external attributes and fixed DOS timestamp fields
  + two independent staging archives must be byte and SHA256 equal before same-volume atomic file publication
  + companion evidence contains only source target identities archive and entry hashes deterministic results safety denials and nonauthority

& [IndependentVerification]
  + verifier closes every JSON field set and source lineage before reading the ZIP without extraction
  + exact allowlist metadata entry hashes README and manifest rederivation and current-binary byte equality must all pass
  + adversarial tests cover independent generation explicit replacement three producer refusals and fifteen report or ZIP refusals

& [Boundary]
  + the checked ZIP is portable package identity not an installer publisher signature delivery channel configuration system compatibility promise operator product or production product
  + no key token config corpus state log service provider persistence effect remote FPGA or Minecraft surface
